NEAR-03: Dispersion: a tridiagonal solve without a chain of divisions

Each row of the dispersion system's forward elimination waited for the
division of the row before it. Factor the system while it is built, and
keep the divisions off that chain. Results change at the level of
rounding.

Requires: none
Results: near (concentrations move at the level of rounding; see 2-near-identical/README.md)

Apply from the root of an EPANET-MSX checkout at 85a303d, after FIX-01, FIX-02
and BIT-01 to BIT-17 (the other near-identical changes are not needed):
    git apply --whitespace=nowarn NEAR-03.patch
or use tools/build-msx.sh, which applies the series in order.

